# Tab and Shift+Tab indent and outdent the edited task while typing goes on.
file <<END
Project:
	- Write draft
END
see Write draft
keys j <Enter> <Enter>
type Outline
keys <Tab>
type  first
keys <Enter>
type Review
keys <S-Tab> <Esc>
see - Review
quit
saved <<END
Project:
	- Write draft
		- Outline first
	- Review
END
